WEBVTT

00:01.080 --> 00:06.520
<i>At present, the Healers' Guild 
cannot censure clinics or healers.</i>

00:06.830 --> 00:10.110
<i>If a healer charges exorbitant prices 
or causes confrontation,</i>

00:10.510 --> 00:13.700
<i>headquarters used to dispatch someone.</i>

00:15.510 --> 00:17.450
<i>Then I promise you this...</i>

00:18.280 --> 00:22.350
<i>I will never become a corrupt healer!</i>

00:24.710 --> 00:25.850
Excuse me!

00:28.740 --> 00:30.730
I will heal them!

00:34.990 --> 00:37.200
Hang in there. You'll be fine.

00:37.200 --> 00:40.110
All right, I'm going to begin healing.

00:40.720 --> 00:45.260
O Lord, I offer up my magic
so that I may mend this wound.

00:48.440 --> 00:50.260
H-Heal!

00:53.700 --> 00:55.400
Hey! What the hell are you doing?

00:55.400 --> 00:57.620
I-I'm sorry...

00:57.620 --> 01:02.580
<i>I can't waste a single casting, but I
got nervous and couldn't picture the spell!</i>

01:02.580 --> 01:05.000
<i>Get it together, man!</i>

01:06.720 --> 01:11.150
O Lord, I offer up my magic
so that I may mend this wound.

01:11.880 --> 01:16.590
<i>I have to imagine it...
a wounding in reverse.</i>

01:17.680 --> 01:18.900
Heal!

01:28.250 --> 01:29.360
Good.

01:32.530 --> 01:36.780
<b>The Great Cleric</b>

01:33.650 --> 01:36.780
A Salaryman's <b>Path </b>to <b>Surviving Another World</b>

03:01.390 --> 03:02.560
Heal!

03:05.380 --> 03:07.940
This is the last one. We're counting on you!

03:08.400 --> 03:13.360
<i>I've messed up a few times. 
How many more can I do?</i>

03:16.340 --> 03:18.280
Hey! Are you okay?!

03:19.060 --> 03:20.800
<i>You've got to be kidding me...</i>

03:20.800 --> 03:23.140
<i>I can't run out of magic now...</i>

03:23.140 --> 03:24.730
Hang in there!

03:24.730 --> 03:27.560
Don't you die on me here! Hey!

03:28.140 --> 03:33.510
<i>Not when there's still... 
someone left to save...</i>

03:35.900 --> 03:38.150
#2 The Adventurers' Guild

03:45.020 --> 03:46.770
<i>You don't need to apologize.</i>

03:47.400 --> 03:50.250
<i>You saved everyone else's hide.</i>

03:50.250 --> 03:53.110
<i>Thanks, healer guy.</i>

03:54.810 --> 03:57.500
<i>I have to level up as a healer!</i>

03:57.820 --> 04:01.650
<i>And to do that, I'll build 
experience at the Adventurers' Guild</i>

04:01.650 --> 04:04.590
<i>and polish my skills to survive in this world!</i>

04:08.030 --> 04:09.810
Whoa!

04:15.480 --> 04:16.560
Wow.

04:18.070 --> 04:20.110
Jeez!

04:20.520 --> 04:21.280
Huh?

04:25.220 --> 04:28.780
Excuse me. I'd like
to register as an adventurer.

04:30.910 --> 04:32.540
Wow!

04:32.540 --> 04:35.770
Hello! Welcome to the Adventurers' Guild.

04:36.920 --> 04:40.130
<i>Bunny ears! She's a rabbit person!</i>

04:40.790 --> 04:43.740
Please fill out your name, race, and age.

04:45.010 --> 04:47.890
Then channel your blood
 or magic into this card.

04:47.890 --> 04:49.050
Sure.

04:49.520 --> 04:53.370
<i>Jeez, I'd better watch myself. 
This is work. Work, I tell you!</i>

04:51.140 --> 04:54.750
Merratoni Adventurers' Guild Registration Form

04:51.140 --> 04:54.750
Applicant Information

04:51.140 --> 04:54.750
Race

04:51.140 --> 04:54.750
Human

04:51.140 --> 04:54.750
Name

04:51.140 --> 04:54.750
Luciel

04:51.140 --> 04:54.750
Address

04:51.140 --> 04:54.750
Age

04:51.140 --> 04:54.750
Level

04:55.320 --> 04:57.380
Luciel-sama, correct?

04:57.380 --> 05:01.860
You have the martial arts skill, so there's no
problem with you registering as an adventurer.

05:01.860 --> 05:05.870
<i>Does that mean I couldn't register without it?</i>

05:05.870 --> 05:09.530
Now then, I'll explain how contracts work.

05:09.530 --> 05:11.030
Me! I'll do it!

05:09.740 --> 05:12.240
<b>I'll accept
that request</b>

05:10.210 --> 05:14.250
When adventurers fulfill requests, 
they receive compensation.

05:12.490 --> 05:14.000
<b>Complete!!
50 copper coins!!</b>

05:14.250 --> 05:18.800
However, the guild deducts ten percent
to cover operating expenses.

05:15.120 --> 05:20.000
<b>That'll be 5 coins</b>

05:18.800 --> 05:20.020
Here you go.

05:20.020 --> 05:22.950
What happens if I fail a request?

05:22.950 --> 05:25.600
There are penalties and other 
fees, so please be careful.

05:25.600 --> 05:28.360
<i>If I mess up, I'm so screwed!</i>

05:28.920 --> 05:33.210
It looks like you'll be starting at our
lowest rank, rank H, Luciel-sama.

05:33.210 --> 05:36.560
Okay. I also have a question.

05:36.560 --> 05:40.390
Does the Adventurers' Guild 
ever get requests for healing?

05:40.390 --> 05:41.150
Huh?

05:41.150 --> 05:43.110
Oh, pardon me.

05:44.110 --> 05:55.950
BUSINESS MODE

05:44.340 --> 05:46.820
My job is healer.

05:46.820 --> 05:49.560
So, for instance, if an adventurer

05:49.560 --> 05:52.570
is injured during training and I heal them,

05:52.570 --> 05:55.550
could I put that payment
toward my training fees?

05:55.550 --> 05:56.810
Would that be possible?

05:56.810 --> 05:59.020
Putting your healing fees toward training?

05:59.020 --> 06:00.060
Yes.

06:00.060 --> 06:03.460
Could you introduce me to someone capable

06:03.460 --> 06:07.320
of training me to improve 
my martial arts skills?

06:07.320 --> 06:09.550
Well, let's see...

06:09.940 --> 06:13.940
I think if someone from the guild
is willing to train me,

06:13.940 --> 06:16.590
it'd be an extremely beneficial deal.

06:16.590 --> 06:17.640
What do you think?

06:17.640 --> 06:21.030
That's not a call I can make on my own.

06:21.550 --> 06:24.480
Could I ask you to wait here a moment?

06:24.480 --> 06:27.110
Sure. Thank you for your help.

06:27.610 --> 06:29.980
<i>Sweet. I did everything I could.</i>

06:29.980 --> 06:33.000
<i>Now I just need to trust
 in Monster Luck-sensei!</i>

06:33.000 --> 06:35.200
Leave it to me, boy!

06:33.080 --> 06:35.200
<b>Leave it 
to me, boy!</b>

06:36.520 --> 06:38.030
Thank you for your patience.

06:38.540 --> 06:40.460
This is Luciel-sama.

06:42.540 --> 06:45.220
<i>That guy looks tough as hell!</i>

06:45.220 --> 06:48.460
<i>But wait, I had a tough-looking 
boss in my past life, too.</i>

06:48.460 --> 06:51.140
<i>If I judge by appearances, 
it'll only set me back.</i>

06:51.140 --> 06:53.890
Hello! My name is Luciel.

06:53.890 --> 06:56.420
I'd like to train my fighting
and magic recovery skills,

06:56.420 --> 07:00.320
so would you be willing to teach me
martial arts in exchange for healing services?

07:02.280 --> 07:05.270
That's a pretty odd request for a healer.

07:05.270 --> 07:08.250
You don't want to keep your precious money?

07:08.250 --> 07:09.240
Huh?

07:09.240 --> 07:12.050
You do seem to have the martial arts skill,

07:12.050 --> 07:15.030
but why's a healer want to learn how to fight?

07:16.600 --> 07:18.620
I'd be worthless in real combat.

07:20.580 --> 07:24.630
If I go on a journey, even a weak
monster could surely kill me.

07:24.630 --> 07:26.040
So, to prevent that,

07:27.530 --> 07:30.380
I want to become strong 
enough to defend myself!

07:32.320 --> 07:33.450
Hmm.

07:34.860 --> 07:38.710
All right then. I'll take you on as
our training hall recovery specialist.

07:38.710 --> 07:40.060
<i>Success!</i>

07:40.060 --> 07:43.170
Your wages will be one silver coin per day.

07:43.620 --> 07:46.160
I'll deduct your training fees from that.

07:46.160 --> 07:47.650
When can you start?

07:47.650 --> 07:50.850
In that case, please allow me 
to start in six days!

07:50.850 --> 07:51.860
Got it.

07:51.860 --> 07:54.520
Nanaella, take care of the arrangements.

07:54.520 --> 07:56.450
Yes, I will.

07:57.250 --> 07:59.310
My name is Nanaella.

08:00.200 --> 08:03.170
Nanaella

08:00.700 --> 08:02.320
I'm very glad to meet you!

08:03.170 --> 08:04.990
I'm Luciel!

08:04.990 --> 08:07.510
It's nice to meet you... too?

08:08.910 --> 08:11.820
<i>Why is everyone staring at me like that?</i>

08:17.970 --> 08:21.230
<i>This guy must be really important.</i>

08:22.470 --> 08:25.950
I'm Brod, chief instructor here at the guild.

08:23.440 --> 08:27.060
Brod

08:26.340 --> 08:29.190
I'll be waiting for you in six days, kid.

08:31.690 --> 08:34.150
Yes, sir! Thank you very much!

08:37.610 --> 08:42.390
<i>So far so good, but if 
my magic recovery can't keep up,</i>

08:42.390 --> 08:44.710
<i>they're liable to lose faith in me.</i>

08:46.920 --> 08:51.510
<i>I've got to use every last bit of energy 
I have now to make sure that doesn't happen.</i>

08:52.350 --> 08:53.210
Yes?

08:55.200 --> 08:59.010
Luciel-sama, I've brought your meal.

08:59.510 --> 09:00.740
Monika-san!

09:02.830 --> 09:04.690
Was your outing productive?

09:04.690 --> 09:05.840
Yes.

09:06.150 --> 09:08.350
I now know where I'm going 
after training here.

09:08.350 --> 09:10.070
Congratulations!

09:10.070 --> 09:13.560
But before then, I have to improve 
my skills at least a little more.

09:13.560 --> 09:14.750
Thank you for the meal!

09:14.750 --> 09:16.560
Do the best you can, okay?

09:17.210 --> 09:22.660
By the way, for holy magic affinity, 
what sort of skill level should I be aiming for?

09:22.660 --> 09:24.940
If you reach level 5 by twenty years old,

09:24.940 --> 09:27.210
I hear that's considered quite talented.

09:27.210 --> 09:29.250
So level 5 in the next five years, huh?

09:29.250 --> 09:32.380
I wonder if I can gain one level each year.

09:33.940 --> 09:37.720
Say, if you get to level 5 by the time
you turn twenty, Luciel-sama,

09:38.700 --> 09:40.120
take me on a date.

09:40.120 --> 09:42.350
<i>Take me on a date... Take me on a date...</i>

09:42.350 --> 09:44.380
<i>A... d-d-d-d-d-d—</i>

09:45.420 --> 09:46.890
Are you all right?

09:47.270 --> 09:51.610
<i>A date? Does she mean </i>that<i> kind of date?</i>

09:51.610 --> 09:55.280
<i>Oh, this is crazy! I'm gonna work so hard!</i>

09:56.260 --> 09:58.060
<i>One week later...</i>

09:58.440 --> 10:02.940
<i>My long crash course in holy 
magic went by in a flash.</i>

10:02.940 --> 10:05.060
<i>At last, I was done.</i>

10:10.680 --> 10:12.750
Good morning, Kururu-san.

10:14.450 --> 10:15.840
Luciel-kun.

10:16.210 --> 10:17.170
I see.

10:17.830 --> 10:20.220
It's already been ten days, has it?

10:20.220 --> 10:23.430
Yes. I appreciate everything you've done.

10:23.900 --> 10:25.630
Thanks to you and everyone else,

10:25.630 --> 10:28.440
I've learned enough magic 
to get my start as a healer.

10:28.440 --> 10:30.430
I'm truly grateful for that.

10:30.430 --> 10:32.650
You're very impressive, Luciel-kun.

10:32.650 --> 10:34.900
You even have a job lined up
starting today, no?

10:34.900 --> 10:38.770
I'm sure that you'll make a wonderful 
healer, so please do your best.

10:38.770 --> 10:39.860
I will!

10:40.320 --> 10:44.030
Also, if you run into Lumina-sama, 
be sure to thank her as well.

10:44.030 --> 10:47.000
Yes, I will the next time I see her.

10:49.500 --> 10:51.700
Well then, I'm off!

10:52.040 --> 10:56.460
<i>That's right! This is a fresh start for me!</i>

11:07.480 --> 11:09.140
Time to face the music!

11:13.660 --> 11:16.190
Hey. That's him there.

11:16.190 --> 11:18.200
The guy from before!

11:18.200 --> 11:20.160
<i>It feels like everyone's staring.</i>

11:20.160 --> 11:25.330
<i>This is like when my numbers were bad 
and I had to go try to make direct sales.</i>

11:20.360 --> 11:25.330
<b>That cold stare...</b>

11:28.520 --> 11:31.290
Are you here to make a request?
 Or file a report?

11:31.290 --> 11:32.800
<i>She's cute!</i>

11:32.800 --> 11:36.110
<i>The girls in this world are all so pretty!</i>

11:37.330 --> 11:41.130
My name is Luciel. I've asked 
Brod-san to train me to fight.

11:41.130 --> 11:45.500
Ah, you must be that new adventurer.

11:45.500 --> 11:49.110
This staircase will take you 
to the underground training hall.

12:00.360 --> 12:03.640
Whoa, it's huge!

12:03.640 --> 12:06.480
I guess no one else is here yet.

12:06.480 --> 12:08.450
Hey there, rookie!

12:10.410 --> 12:12.740
I'm glad you didn't try to sneak off.

12:15.510 --> 12:18.550
<i>Dude seriously looks like he's primed to kill.</i>

12:18.550 --> 12:21.290
Pretty nice training hall, huh?

12:21.290 --> 12:23.180
We've got it all to ourselves.

12:23.180 --> 12:26.520
<i>What? No way. I'm the only one training here?</i>

12:27.030 --> 12:30.020
S-Sir! Thank you for this opportunity!

12:30.020 --> 12:31.050
Huh.

12:31.390 --> 12:35.480
You saw the killer look 
in my eyes and still didn't flee.

12:35.480 --> 12:38.080
<i>He was doing that on purpose?</i>

12:38.080 --> 12:43.110
I need these skills to survive,
so please train me as hard as you can.

12:43.110 --> 12:46.300
Actions speak louder than words.

12:46.300 --> 12:48.200
I'm not going easy on you!

12:48.680 --> 12:50.120
Don't even think of running.

12:51.120 --> 12:52.870
<i>Yikes!</i>

12:55.160 --> 12:58.180
<i>He's like one of those intense bosses
 who only believes in the hustle!</i>

12:58.710 --> 13:00.030
Move like you mean it!

13:00.030 --> 13:02.920
If you wimp out, you're 
gonna become goblin chow!

13:02.920 --> 13:05.450
<i>First day and he's already bullying me?</i>

13:05.450 --> 13:08.220
<i>This world has toxic workplaces too?!</i>

13:08.220 --> 13:10.100
You'll inevitably run out of energy.

13:10.100 --> 13:12.930
You'll just have to force
 yourself to keep going!

13:12.930 --> 13:15.770
<b>Mad Dash</b>

13:13.640 --> 13:15.790
Y-Yes, sir!

13:15.790 --> 13:19.940
For an adventurer, stopping means 
only one thing! And that's death!

13:19.940 --> 13:23.180
<i>This is so, so, so hard!</i>

13:23.180 --> 13:26.490
<i>But I'm kinda starting to enjoy it!</i>

13:26.490 --> 13:32.040
<i>When I think about how I couldn't even
 move there at the end, this is the best!</i>

13:32.040 --> 13:35.220
<i>I mean, this is basically heaven!</i>

13:35.220 --> 13:37.750
<i>Heaven... Heaven...</i>

13:37.750 --> 13:39.420
<i>I'm breathing.</i>

13:39.420 --> 13:41.670
<i>I'm moving my body.</i>

13:41.670 --> 13:45.630
<i>I'm really living!</i>

13:49.740 --> 13:53.700
Don't tell me you passed out from just that.

14:00.360 --> 14:02.990
That hurts!

14:02.990 --> 14:04.700
You're too stiff.

14:04.700 --> 14:07.010
You're in for an injury like this.

14:07.010 --> 14:09.670
It hurts! It really hurts!

14:09.670 --> 14:13.870
Stretch to improve your range of motion,
and you'll improve your range of attack, too.

14:13.870 --> 14:17.630
You'll also have greater flexibility
dodging enemy attacks.

14:17.630 --> 14:19.080
Too much!

14:19.080 --> 14:21.710
<i>He's a lot more practical than I expected.</i>

14:21.710 --> 14:25.170
<i>Here I thought he'd go with a more 
cerebral, Spartan approach.</i>

14:25.170 --> 14:26.590
You've got a long way to go!

14:30.760 --> 14:34.920
Next up, I don't care how, 
but try to land an attack on me.

14:37.530 --> 14:38.620
Yah!

14:40.590 --> 14:43.710
Oh boy. Is this seriously the level you're at?

14:43.710 --> 14:46.150
That's why I asked you to train me.

14:46.150 --> 14:49.310
Ah, gotcha. In that case, sorry.

14:51.100 --> 14:52.680
But you are motivated, right?

14:52.680 --> 14:56.870
I want to get to the point where 
I can face adventurers without flinching.

14:57.440 --> 15:02.820
Good enough. Then use your arms and legs 
and come at me with everything you got.

15:02.820 --> 15:03.960
Yes, sir!

15:03.960 --> 15:04.750
Too slow.

15:06.090 --> 15:07.050
Too slow!

15:07.930 --> 15:09.090
Way too slow!

15:10.240 --> 15:11.800
<i>How Spartan...</i>

15:11.800 --> 15:14.050
The real fight begins when you're worn out.

15:14.050 --> 15:16.820
First, you need to learn how to move.

15:16.820 --> 15:18.020
Yes, sir!

15:18.020 --> 15:22.050
Try to clearly visualize landing
an attack so you don't get sloppy.

15:22.050 --> 15:22.810
Yes, sir!

15:23.610 --> 15:26.170
<i>I know I'm an amateur.</i>

15:26.170 --> 15:31.460
<i>I did martial arts in gym class, 
but I've never even been in a fistfight.</i>

15:33.630 --> 15:36.280
<i>I have to picture landing that hit.</i>

15:36.280 --> 15:38.160
<i>And then, more than that...</i>

15:39.340 --> 15:40.290
<i>It's all about range!</i>

15:40.290 --> 15:45.150
<i>I need to figure out how close
I have to get to connect with a strike.</i>

15:48.340 --> 15:52.620
<i>This is seriously tough. I want to quit.</i>

15:53.360 --> 15:54.360
<i>But...</i>

15:55.670 --> 15:56.680
Oh?

15:59.400 --> 16:05.110
<i>But if I quit now, then
my fresh start goes stale here!</i>

16:06.240 --> 16:07.450
Here I come!

16:07.450 --> 16:08.830
<i>I've made my mind up.</i>

16:08.830 --> 16:10.860
<i>Someday, I swear it...</i>

16:12.040 --> 16:14.210
<i>I'm going to hit him!</i>

16:21.250 --> 16:23.250
You held up pretty good.

16:23.670 --> 16:25.630
I'll admit you've at least got guts.

16:26.370 --> 16:30.810
Say, kid, what are the most 
important things in battle?

16:33.300 --> 16:36.760
Not dying and not getting injured.

16:36.760 --> 16:39.850
To that end, you've first
gotta learn how to move.

16:40.410 --> 16:44.540
But don't try to immediately use 
what you just learned in battle.

16:44.540 --> 16:45.270
Huh?

16:45.610 --> 16:48.240
You need to repeat this
until it becomes second nature.

16:48.560 --> 16:50.180
And I bet you know why.

16:50.550 --> 16:52.560
Because if I don't really know what I'm doing,

16:52.560 --> 16:55.570
it'll come back to bite me, right?

16:55.570 --> 16:56.610
That's right.

16:56.610 --> 17:00.320
So watch and learn, then try it out on me.

17:00.650 --> 17:02.660
You've got a great role model right here.

17:02.660 --> 17:04.530
<i>Oh yeah...</i>

17:04.530 --> 17:09.990
<i>When I was a new employee, I used to follow 
my coworkers around to learn by example.</i>

17:10.720 --> 17:11.760
Yes, sir!

17:11.760 --> 17:13.080
Good.

17:13.080 --> 17:16.890
Now that you've caught your breath, 
it's time to start the second round.

17:16.890 --> 17:20.640
Huh? The second round?

17:21.500 --> 17:24.410
Pain. My whole body is in pain.

17:23.180 --> 17:25.540
Let's call it for today, kid.

17:26.950 --> 17:31.730
Oh, hey, if I use heal on myself, 
I can kill two birds with one stone.

17:31.730 --> 17:33.110
Not so fast.

17:33.510 --> 17:37.070
If you avoid magical healing
and instead rely on natural healing,

17:37.070 --> 17:41.160
you'll develop the skill to increase 
your physical recovery.

17:41.160 --> 17:44.380
Don't heal yourself unless you're really hurt.

17:44.850 --> 17:46.260
Understood.

17:46.260 --> 17:49.300
By the way, I'm surprised 
there's no one else here.

17:49.300 --> 17:52.500
Yeah, we don't get many newcomers these days.

17:53.030 --> 17:56.370
Low-ranking adventurers 
don't have money to spare,

17:56.370 --> 17:59.000
so they focus more 
on real battle than training.

17:59.000 --> 18:00.260
I see.

18:00.610 --> 18:03.640
That must be tough for them.

18:05.160 --> 18:08.460
I don't know how effective 
healing would be on myself,

18:08.460 --> 18:12.770
but I'd rather save it 
to use on adventurers instead.

18:16.810 --> 18:18.820
Promise me something, kid.

18:19.160 --> 18:20.200
What is it?

18:20.600 --> 18:25.820
That you'll heal whoever needs it,
 regardless of their race.

18:26.750 --> 18:27.910
I will.

18:32.390 --> 18:33.250
Is this the place?

18:34.060 --> 18:37.550
Will you really heal us? And for free?

18:37.550 --> 18:40.980
I knew we shouldn't have come.
 It's gotta be a scam.

18:40.980 --> 18:42.330
What happened to you?

18:44.260 --> 18:47.350
I was bitten by a forest wolf.

18:47.810 --> 18:49.860
Then let me treat you.

18:49.860 --> 18:53.150
Huh? Are you really going to heal me?

18:56.060 --> 19:00.570
O Lord, I offer up my magic
so that I may mend this wound.

19:00.570 --> 19:01.800
Heal!

19:07.940 --> 19:09.430
Does it still hurt?

19:09.770 --> 19:12.750
Th-Thank you. I think it's okay now.

19:13.740 --> 19:16.190
Wow, he really did heal it.

19:16.190 --> 19:20.180
<i>They sure don't trust healers in this town!</i>

19:20.700 --> 19:23.240
Are any of you injured, too?

19:23.860 --> 19:25.450
I am! Look at my arm!

19:25.450 --> 19:26.420
And my leg!

19:26.420 --> 19:27.430
Me too, me too!

19:27.430 --> 19:29.840
I-I'll treat you one at a time!

19:32.440 --> 19:35.150
You're gonna be busy as a healer.

19:37.510 --> 19:38.750
I'll do my best.

19:39.130 --> 19:41.130
Um, Brod-san?

19:41.940 --> 19:46.740
All I can use right now is heal, 
and only eight times in a row.

19:47.220 --> 19:49.070
Is that going to be enough?

19:49.070 --> 19:51.240
If you can do that much, it'll be plenty.

19:51.650 --> 19:53.370
But I have a suggestion.

19:54.030 --> 19:57.450
I want you to use heal until 
you're almost out of magic

19:57.450 --> 19:59.990
to build up your strength 
like we did here today.

20:01.480 --> 20:02.890
How does that sound?

20:02.890 --> 20:04.460
<i>Well, that's...</i>

20:04.050 --> 20:06.530
<b>Work.</b>

20:06.050 --> 20:08.040
<b>And more work.</b>

20:07.560 --> 20:09.540
<b>Packed trains.</b>

20:08.320 --> 20:11.180
<i>no different from my last life.</i>

20:09.060 --> 20:11.020
<b>And just sleeping.</b>

20:11.180 --> 20:14.730
<i>But trusting in him is 
probably best for my future.</i>

20:15.860 --> 20:17.190
I'll follow your lead.

20:17.190 --> 20:21.650
Great. First, we need to build 
up your strength for training.

20:21.650 --> 20:25.460
<i>We haven't even started training yet?</i>

20:27.120 --> 20:31.870
<i>I think my martial arts skills will 
improve on their own if I keep this up.</i>

20:31.870 --> 20:36.040
<i>If I heal people to build up 
my holy magic affinity too,</i>

20:36.040 --> 20:41.010
<i>then meditate in between to 
increase my magic and physical recovery...</i>

20:41.010 --> 20:43.630
<i>How many birds can I kill 
with one stone then?!</i>

20:43.630 --> 20:46.120
<i>And the fact that Brod-san 
is still sticking with me</i>

20:46.120 --> 20:49.250
<i>must be thanks to Monster Luck-sensei again!</i>

20:49.250 --> 20:51.690
You better believe it, boy!

20:52.670 --> 20:55.320
<i>I made the right choice coming here!</i>

20:55.750 --> 20:56.850
Oh yeah. Hey, kid.

20:57.780 --> 21:01.160
I can tell that you've got some guts.

21:01.160 --> 21:05.440
But if you're really serious about training,
 you should live here at the guild.

21:06.040 --> 21:10.080
Would that be okay? I don't have much money.

21:11.300 --> 21:12.540
I meant for free.

21:12.540 --> 21:13.160
Huh?

21:13.160 --> 21:14.550
Also...

21:14.550 --> 21:15.540
Also?

21:15.540 --> 21:18.000
Also, you'll get three meals a day.

21:19.260 --> 21:21.460
<i>What?! What a deal!</i>

21:21.460 --> 21:25.570
That sounds too good to be true! 
Are there any strings?

21:25.910 --> 21:29.920
I want to increase the survival rate 
for our inexperienced adventurers.

21:30.800 --> 21:33.140
I can make it happen with you here, kid.

21:35.710 --> 21:37.100
I suppose so.

21:40.250 --> 21:44.050
I want to save all the lives that I can.

21:45.300 --> 21:49.520
But not just adventurers. I want to 
save anyone who comes to me.

21:49.950 --> 21:52.130
And if that will make me stronger,

21:52.130 --> 21:55.480
then I beg you to let me do it!

21:58.640 --> 22:01.590
If there were more healers like you, kid,

22:01.590 --> 22:05.400
the world might be a better place.

22:07.310 --> 22:10.510
<i>I feel like he's getting
a little ahead of himself.</i>

22:11.450 --> 22:14.210
<i>But after coming to another world,</i>

22:14.210 --> 22:17.560
<i>I think I'm finally starting anew.</i>

22:18.170 --> 22:23.420
<i>Yeah. This will be how I start surviving here!</i>

23:55.350 --> 23:59.700
Heya, Luciel. For the next month, 
I'm gonna train the hell out of you.

23:59.700 --> 24:02.420
Come on! What are you whining about?

24:02.420 --> 24:06.340
Ten or twenty broken bones is nothing.

24:06.340 --> 24:08.270
Next time: "A Talent for Martial Arts."

24:06.960 --> 24:10.010
#3 A Talent for Martial Arts

24:08.270 --> 24:09.960
Don't try to run away, Luciel!
